Update Steps

Make sure your working tree has the latest commits you want live (merge, test, etc.).

## npm run build
to produce the production bundle in dist/.

# Push the bundle to GitHub Pages with 
## npm run deploy

(it invokes gh-pages -d dist); this updates the gh-pages branch that serves the site.

### Keep bumping APP_VERSION before future deployments so the badge and metadata stay in sync; consider wiring a release script or CI step to automate that if desired.